From: Sighalong <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:59:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] 0035 sound member keeps its loop flag across unload/reload

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 engines/director/castmember/sound.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/engines/director/castmember/sound.cpp b/engines/director/castmember/sound.cpp
index b87c67e..94613f0 100644
--- a/engines/director/castmember/sound.cpp
+++ b/engines/director/castmember/sound.cpp
@@ -219,7 +219,7 @@ void SoundCastMember::unload() {
 	delete _audio;
 	_audio = nullptr;
 	_size = 0;
-	_looping = false;
+	// _looping is member data (cast info flag, or set from Lingo): keep it across unload/reload
 
 	_loaded = false;
 }
